msgstr "treure el perfil mesurat"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Wind and temperature of {name}"
msgstr "Vent i temperatura de {name}"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Box"
msgstr "Recinte rectangular"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Length (x)"
msgstr "Llargada (x)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Width (y)"
msgstr "Amplada (y)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Height (z)"
msgstr "Alçada (z)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "How long the room is along x, in the units the title shows"
msgstr "La llargada del recinte al llarg de x, en les unitats del títol"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "How wide the room is along y, in the units the title shows"
msgstr "L'amplada del recinte al llarg de y, en les unitats del títol"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "How high the room is, floor to ceiling, in the units the title shows"
msgstr "L'alçada del recinte, del terra al sostre, en les unitats del títol"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Floor plan"
msgstr "Planta"

#. Translators: {axis} is x or y.
#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {axis} of each corner, in the units the title shows; the corners go "
"round the room in turn"
msgstr ""
"La coordenada {axis} de cada vèrtex, en les unitats del títol; els vèrtexs "
"recorren el contorn del recinte en ordre"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Add corner"
msgstr "Afegir vèrtex"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py acoustic_spaces/gui/plan_view.py
msgid "Remove corner"
msgstr "Eliminar vèrtex"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Add a corner halfway between the last corner and the first"
msgstr "Afegir un vèrtex al punt mitjà entre l'últim vèrtex i el primer"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Remove the selected corner, or the last one when none is selected"
msgstr ""
"Eliminar el vèrtex seleccionat o l'últim si no n'hi ha cap de seleccionat"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Alçada"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "The model file the room comes from"
msgstr "El fitxer de model del qual prové el recinte"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Choose another file…"
msgstr "Triar un altre fitxer…"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Take the room from another model file; the materials and their assignments "
"stay"
msgstr ""
"Prendre el recinte d'un altre fitxer de model; es mantenen els materials i "
"les assignacions"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "file default"
msgstr "per defecte del fitxer"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"The unit the model's lengths are in; file default: the units a DXF, IFC or "
"Collada file records, else metres"
msgstr ""
"La unitat de les longituds del model; per defecte del fitxer: les unitats "
"que indica un fitxer DXF, IFC o Collada, i metres en els altres casos"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "format default"
msgstr "per defecte del format"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"The axis that points up in the model; format default: y for glTF and "
"SketchUp, the one a Collada file records, z for the others (Blender's OBJ "
"export writes y up)"
msgstr ""
"L'eix vertical del model; per defecte del format: y per a glTF i SketchUp, "
"el que indica un fitxer Collada i z per als altres (l'exportació OBJ de "
"Blender fa servir y com a eix vertical)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"The room of an IFC model to take on its own, from its space boundaries; "
"every element reads walls as solids, with both sides"
msgstr ""
"El recinte d'un model IFC que s'extreu per separat a partir dels seus límits "
"espacials; l'opció «tots els elements» llegeix les parets com a sòlids, amb "
"les dues cares"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Units"
msgstr "Unitats"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Up axis"
msgstr "Eix vertical"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "IFC room"
msgstr "Recinte IFC"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"The height (z) of the flat ground, or added to the terrain's heights, in the "
"units the title shows"
msgstr ""
"L'alçada (z) del terreny pla, o sumada a les alçades del relleu, en les "
"unitats del títol"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"How far the ground reaches past the buildings, barriers and model, unless "
"its extent is set or a terrain sets its size, and how high the sky is over "
"the highest of them, unless the sky is set; in the units the title shows"
msgstr ""
"Fins on arriba el terreny més enllà dels edificis, les pantalles i el model, "
"si no se'n fixa l'extensió o un relleu en fixa la mida, i a quina alçada "
"queda el cel sobre el més alt, si no es fixa el cel; en les unitats del títol"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"How high the open sky lies over the ground, in the units the title shows; "
"auto: the margin over the highest building, barrier or model part. Sound "
"that reaches the sky leaves the scene"
msgstr ""
"A quina alçada queda el cel obert sobre el terreny, en les unitats del "
"títol; automàtic: el marge sobre l'edifici, la pantalla o la part del model "
"més alta. El so que arriba al cel surt de l'escena"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Ground height"
msgstr "Alçada del terreny"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Margin"
msgstr "Marge"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Sky"
msgstr "Cel"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Extent"
msgstr "Extensió"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Where the ground ends, from its south-west corner (x, y) to its north-east "
"one, in the units the title shows; off: the margin round the buildings, "
"barriers and model, or the whole terrain. Past the ground's edge, sound "
"leaves the scene as if the ground went on"
msgstr ""
"On acaba el terreny, de la cantonada sud-oest (x, y) a la nord-est, en les "
"unitats del títol; desactivat: el marge al voltant dels edificis, les "
"pantalles i el model, o el relleu sencer. Més enllà de la vora del terreny, "
"el so surt de l'escena com si el terreny continués"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "x where the ground starts (its west edge)"
msgstr "x on comença el terreny (la vora oest)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "y where the ground starts (its south edge)"
msgstr "y on comença el terreny (la vora sud)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "x where the ground ends (its east edge)"
msgstr "x on acaba el terreny (la vora est)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "y where the ground ends (its north edge)"
msgstr "y on acaba el terreny (la vora nord)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Where the ground ends: past it, sound leaves the scene as if the ground went "
"on"
msgstr ""
"On acaba el terreny: més enllà, el so surt de l'escena com si el terreny "
"continués"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"The terrain the ground follows: its heights on a grid, from a file or given "
"in the scene file, sampled over the ground's extent"
msgstr ""
"El relleu que segueix el terreny: les seves alçades en una quadrícula, d'un "
"fitxer o donades al fitxer d'escena, mostrejades sobre l'extensió del terreny"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Terrain from a file…"
msgstr "Relleu des d'un fitxer…"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Make the ground follow the heights in a file: an Esri ASCII grid (.asc) or x "
"y z points on a regular grid (.xyz, .txt, .csv), in the units the title "
"shows. The terrain sets the ground's size, unless an extent inside it is set"
msgstr ""
"Fer que el terreny segueixi les alçades d'un fitxer: una quadrícula Esri "
"ASCII (.asc) o punts x y z en una quadrícula regular (.xyz, .txt, .csv), en "
"les unitats del títol. El relleu fixa la mida del terreny, llevat que se'n "
"fixi una extensió a dins"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Remove terrain"
msgstr "Eliminar relleu"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Flatten the ground again, at the ground height, with the margin round the "
"parts"
msgstr ""
"Tornar a aplanar el terreny, a l'alçada del terreny, amb el marge al voltant "
"dels elements"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Buildings"
msgstr "Edificis"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Corners"
msgstr "Vèrtexs"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "The building's name; its surfaces are named after it"
msgstr "El nom de l'edifici; les seves superfícies porten el seu nom"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "How high the building is, ground to roof, in the units the title shows"
msgstr ""
"L'alçada de l'edifici, del terreny a la coberta, en les unitats del títol"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "How many corners the building's footprint has (as drawn in the plan)"
msgstr ""
"Quants vèrtexs té la petjada de l'edifici (tal com s'ha dibuixat a la planta)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Remove the selected building, or the last one when none is selected"
msgstr ""
"Eliminar l'edifici seleccionat o l'últim si no n'hi ha cap de seleccionat"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Add building"
msgstr "Afegir edifici"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Draw a building's footprint in the plan, corner by corner, and close it on "
"the first corner; it rises {height:g} m from the ground, to change in the "
"table"
msgstr ""
"Dibuixar la petjada d'un edifici a la planta, vèrtex a vèrtex, i tancar-la "
"al primer; s'alça {height:g} m sobre el terreny, a canviar a la taula"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Remove building"
msgstr "Eliminar edifici"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Barriers"
msgstr "Pantalles acústiques"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Points"
msgstr "Punts"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "The barrier's name, which its surfaces carry"
msgstr "El nom de la pantalla, que porten les seves superfícies"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "How high the barrier is over the ground, in the units the title shows"
msgstr "L'alçada de la pantalla sobre el terreny, en les unitats del títol"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "How many points the barrier's path has (as drawn in the plan)"
msgstr ""
"Quants punts té el traçat de la pantalla (tal com s'ha dibuixat a la planta)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Remove the selected barrier, or the last one when none is selected"
msgstr ""
"Eliminar la pantalla seleccionada o l'última si no n'hi ha cap de "
"seleccionada"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Add barrier"
msgstr "Afegir pantalla"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Draw a barrier's path in the plan, point by point, and finish it with Enter "
"or a double click; it stands {height:g} m high, to change in the table"
msgstr ""
"Dibuixar el traçat d'una pantalla a la planta, punt a punt, i acabar-lo amb "
"Retorn o doble clic; fa {height:g} m d'alçada, a canviar a la taula"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Remove barrier"
msgstr "Eliminar pantalla"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Vegetation"
msgstr "Vegetació"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Shape"
msgstr "Forma"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Plants"
msgstr "Plantes"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"The name of the tree, hedge or belt of trees: no surface, a volume that "
"sound passes through, losing some of itself"
msgstr ""
"El nom de l'arbre, la tanca o la franja d'arbres: no és una superfície, sinó "
"un volum que el so travessa, perdent-ne una part"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "How high its top is over the ground, in the units the title shows"
msgstr ""
"L'alçada de la seva part superior sobre el terreny, en les unitats del títol"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"A belt of trees (a footprint raised from the ground), a hedge (a path of a "
"width) or a lone tree's crown, as drawn in the plan"
msgstr ""
"Una franja d'arbres (una petjada elevada des del terreny), una tanca (un "
"traçat amb una amplada) o la capçada d'un arbre aïllat, tal com s'ha "
"dibuixat a la planta"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"What fills it: foliage, which takes so many dB per metre from sound passing "
"through, or leaves by their area and width, which work that out for "
"themselves; and stems, which scatter it sideways"
msgstr ""
"Què l'omple: fullatge, que resta tants dB per metre al so que el travessa, o "
"fulles per la seva àrea i amplada, que ho calculen per si mateixes; i tiges, "
"que el dispersen cap als costats"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Remove the selected vegetation, or the last one when none is selected"
msgstr ""
"Eliminar la vegetació seleccionada o l'última si no n'hi ha cap de "
"seleccionada"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Add vegetation"
msgstr "Afegir vegetació"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Draw the shape chosen beside in the plan: a belt's footprint closed on its "
"first corner, a hedge's path finished with Enter, or a tree's place with one "
"click; dense foliage, its height to change in the table and the rest in the "
"scene file"
msgstr ""
"Dibuixar a la planta la forma triada al costat: la petjada d'una franja "
"tancada al primer vèrtex, el traçat d'una tanca acabat amb Retorn, o el lloc "
"d'un arbre amb un clic; fullatge dens, l'alçada es canvia a la taula i la "
"resta al fitxer d'escena"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Remove vegetation"
msgstr "Eliminar vegetació"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"What to draw next: a belt of trees (its footprint, corner by corner), a "
"hedge (its path, point by point, {width:g} m wide) or a lone tree (one "
"click, its crown {crown:g} m across)"
msgstr ""
"Què dibuixar a continuació: una franja d'arbres (la petjada, vèrtex a "
"vèrtex), una tanca (el traçat, punt a punt, de {width:g} m d'amplada) o un "
"arbre aïllat (un clic, amb la capçada de {crown:g} m de diàmetre)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"The map the buildings marked 'from the buildings file' come from: a GeoJSON "
"file of footprints, each raised to the height a property of it gives (or one "
"height for all) and named by another"
msgstr ""
"El mapa d'on vénen els edificis marcats com a «del fitxer d'edificis»: un "
"fitxer GeoJSON de petjades, cadascuna elevada fins a l'alçada que dóna una "
"de les seves propietats (o una mateixa alçada per a totes) i amb el nom "
"d'una altra"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Buildings from a map…"
msgstr "Edificis des d'un mapa…"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Add the buildings of a GeoJSON file of footprints, on a plane in the units "
"the title shows (not longitude and latitude), each as high as a property of "
"it says; they join the ones drawn here"
msgstr ""
"Afegir els edificis d'un fitxer GeoJSON de petjades, en un pla en les "
"unitats del títol (no longitud i latitud), cadascun tan alt com digui una de "
"les seves propietats; se sumen als dibuixats aquí"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Remove the map's buildings"
msgstr "Eliminar els edificis del mapa"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Drop the map and every building that came from it; the buildings drawn here "
"stay"
msgstr ""
"Treure el mapa i tots els edificis que en venien; els edificis dibuixats "
"aquí es queden"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Ground zones"
msgstr "Zones del terreny"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"The zone's name: a part of the ground (a road, a lawn) whose surfaces carry "
"it, to give it a material of its own"
msgstr ""
"El nom de la zona: una part del terreny (una carretera, una gespa) les "
"superfícies de la qual el porten, per donar-li un material propi"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "How many corners the zone's outline has (as drawn in the plan)"
msgstr ""
"Quants vèrtexs té el contorn de la zona (tal com s'ha dibuixat a la planta)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Remove zone"
msgstr "Eliminar zona"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Remove the selected ground zone, or the last one when none is selected: its "
"part of the ground takes the ground's material"
msgstr ""
"Eliminar la zona del terreny seleccionada o l'última si no n'hi ha cap de "
"seleccionada: la seva part del terreny pren el material del terreny"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Add zone"
msgstr "Afegir zona"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Draw a part of the ground in the plan, corner by corner, and close it on the "
"first corner; then give its surface a material of its own in the scene tree"
msgstr ""
"Dibuixar una part del terreny a la planta, vèrtex a vèrtex, i tancar-la al "
"primer; després assigneu un material propi a la seva superfície a l'arbre de "
"l'escena"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"A closed model has no gaps: each edge joins two faces. The volume and the "
"reverberation estimates need one; View > Show leaks finds the gaps"
msgstr ""
"Un model tancat no té buits: cada aresta uneix dues cares. El volum i les "
"estimacions de reverberació el necessiten; Veure > Mostrar fuites localitza "
"els buits"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Geometry: {kind}"
msgstr "Geometria: {kind}"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Box ({units})"
msgstr "Recinte rectangular ({units})"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Floor plan ({units})"
msgstr "Planta ({units})"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Outdoors ({units})"
msgstr "A l'aire lliure ({units})"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {axis} of corner {number}"
msgstr "La coordenada {axis} del vèrtex {number}"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "every element"
msgstr "tots els elements"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{count:,} triangles, {area:,.1f} m², closed"
msgstr "{count:,} triangles, {area:,.1f} m², tancat"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{count:,} triangles, {area:,.1f} m², not closed"
msgstr "{count:,} triangles, {area:,.1f} m², no tancat"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "resize box"
msgstr "canviar les dimensions del recinte rectangular"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "floor plan corners need two numbers each"
msgstr "cada vèrtex de la planta necessita dos nombres"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py acoustic_spaces/gui/plan_view.py
msgid "add corner"
msgstr "afegir vèrtex"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py acoustic_spaces/gui/plan_view.py
msgid "remove corner"
msgstr "eliminar vèrtex"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "change height"
msgstr "canviar l'alçada"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Room model"
msgstr "Model del recinte"

#. Translators: two file types of an open dialog, kept apart by ;; (keep it).
#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Room models ({patterns});;All files (*)"
