"defecte."

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Absorption"
msgstr "Absorció"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Scattering"
msgstr "Dispersió"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Sound reduction (dB)"
msgstr "Reducció sonora (dB)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Absorption coefficient (0 to 1): the share of the sound energy the surface "
"takes in at each reflection; 0 reflects everything, 1 takes in everything"
msgstr ""
"Coeficient d'absorció (de 0 a 1): la proporció de l'energia sonora que la "
"superfície absorbeix a cada reflexió; 0 ho reflecteix tot, 1 ho absorbeix tot"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Scattering coefficient (0 to 1): the share of the reflected energy that "
"leaves in random directions rather than as from a mirror; 0 for a smooth "
"surface"
msgstr ""
"Coeficient de dispersió (de 0 a 1): la proporció de l'energia reflectida que "
"surt en direccions aleatòries en lloc de reflectir-se com en un mirall; 0 "
"per a una superfície llisa"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Sound reduction index R (dB): how much quieter the sound is on the other "
"side of the surface, 30 to 60 dB for walls. Typed only when it lets part of "
"the sound through; a blank band takes its neighbour's value"
msgstr ""
"Índex de reducció sonora R (dB): quant s'atenua el so a l'altra banda de la "
"superfície, de 30 a 60 dB per a parets. Només s'indica quan deixa passar "
"part del so; una banda en blanc pren el valor de la veïna"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "nothing"
msgstr "res"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "part of the sound"
msgstr "part del so"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "everything (an opening)"
msgstr "tot (una obertura)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "snow"
msgstr "neu"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "forest floor"
msgstr "sòl de bosc"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "loose soil"
msgstr "sòl solt"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "grass"
msgstr "herba"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "compacted soil"
msgstr "sòl compactat"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "gravel"
msgstr "grava"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "asphalt"
msgstr "asfalt"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "water"
msgstr "aigua"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "flow resistivity below"
msgstr "resistivitat al flux indicada a sota"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Miki"
msgstr "Miki"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Delany-Bazley"
msgstr "Delany-Bazley"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "two-parameter"
msgstr "dos paràmetres"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "local: the same at every angle"
msgstr "local: la mateixa a tots els angles"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "extended: changes with the angle"
msgstr "estesa: canvia amb l'angle"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"The material's name; renaming it renames it in the assignments and the "
"default material too"
msgstr ""
"El nom del material; canviar-lo també el canvia a les assignacions i al "
"material per defecte"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"The entry of the built-in material database the absorption comes from; type "
"to search. Picking one replaces the absorption and keeps the scattering"
msgstr ""
"L'entrada de la base de dades integrada de materials d'on prové l'absorció; "
"escriure per cercar. Triar-ne una substitueix l'absorció i manté la dispersió"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Database entry"
msgstr "Entrada de la base de dades"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Sound that passes through a surface goes on into the room behind it, a "
"partition's at its sound reduction index R (30 to 60 dB for walls), an "
"opening's all of it. What passes counts as absorbed, so the absorption is at "
"least 10^(-R/10), and an opening's is 1."
msgstr ""
"El so que travessa una superfície continua al recinte del darrere: en un "
"element separador, segons l'índex de reducció sonora R (de 30 a 60 dB per a "
"parets); en una obertura, tot. El so transmès compta com a absorbit, de "
"manera que l'absorció és com a mínim 10^(-R/10), i en una obertura és 1."

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Lets through"
msgstr "Deixa passar"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Audience seating"
msgstr "Butaques"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Sound that reaches a listener low over these seats loses more in the 500 Hz "
"to 2 kHz bands, as it passes heads and seat backs (grazing incidence; the "
"fit of Jurkiewicz et al., 2025)"
msgstr ""
"El so que arriba a un receptor a poca alçada sobre aquestes butaques "
"s'atenua més entre 500 Hz i 2 kHz en passar pels caps i els respatllers "
"(incidència rasant; ajust de Jurkiewicz et al., 2025)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Ground impedance"
msgstr "Impedància del terreny"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Ticked, the material is a porous ground (grass, soil, snow, gravel, "
"asphalt): its absorption and its reflection come from its impedance, with "
"the phase and the ground wave that make the dip over the ground outdoors. "
"Unticked, the absorption is as given"
msgstr ""
"Activat, el material és un terreny porós (herba, terra, neu, grava, asfalt): "
"la seva absorció i la seva reflexió surten de la seva impedància, amb la "
"fase i l'ona de superfície que creen la caiguda de nivell sobre el terreny a "
"l'aire lliure. Desactivat, l'absorció és la indicada"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"The kind of ground: the ground classes of Nord2000, from snow (softest) to "
"water and dense concrete (hardest), each with its flow resistivity; or a "
"flow resistivity of your own"
msgstr ""
"El tipus de terreny: les classes de terreny de Nord2000, de la neu (el més "
"tou) a l'aigua i el formigó dens (els més durs), cadascuna amb la seva "
"resistivitat al flux; o una resistivitat al flux pròpia"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"How the impedance follows from the flow resistivity: Miki (passive at every "
"frequency, the default), Delany-Bazley (as most of the literature quotes "
"it), or two-parameter (a porosity that falls with depth, which fits measured "
"grass and soil better)"
msgstr ""
"Com s'obté la impedància a partir de la resistivitat al flux: Miki (passiu a "
"qualsevol freqüència, el predeterminat), Delany-Bazley (tal com el cita la "
"major part de la bibliografia) o dos paràmetres (una porositat que "
"disminueix amb la profunditat, que s'ajusta millor a l'herba i la terra "
"mesurades)"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"How hard it is to push air through the ground: about 10 to 30 kPa s/m² for "
"snow, 200 for grass, 2000 for gravel, 20000 and more for asphalt"
msgstr ""
"Com costa fer passar aire a través del terreny: uns 10 a 30 kPa s/m² per a "
"la neu, 200 per a l'herba, 2000 per a la grava, 20000 o més per a l'asfalt"

#. Translators: a ground layer with no thickness set: as deep as it likes.
#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "deep"
msgstr "profund"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"A layer of the ground this thick on a hard backing (snow on frozen ground, a "
"thin soil over rock); deep: as deep as it likes"
msgstr ""
"Una capa de terreny d'aquest gruix sobre un fons rígid (neu sobre sòl "
"glaçat, una capa fina de terra sobre roca); profund: sense límit de "
"profunditat"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Two-parameter model: how fast the ground's porosity falls with depth"
msgstr ""
"Model de dos paràmetres: com de ràpid disminueix la porositat del terreny "
"amb la profunditat"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"How the ground reacts to sound meeting it at an angle: locally, with the "
"same impedance at every angle (the usual model, right for grass and harder "
"grounds); or extended, sound also travelling sideways inside it, so the "
"impedance a reflection meets changes with its angle, which tells for soft "
"snow, moss, forest floors and thin layers. Not with the two-parameter model"
msgstr ""
"Com reacciona el terra al so que hi arriba amb un angle: localment, amb la "
"mateixa impedància a tots els angles (el model habitual, correcte per a "
"herba i terres més durs); o de manera estesa, amb el so viatjant també de "
"costat dins seu, de manera que la impedància que troba una reflexió canvia "
"amb el seu angle, cosa que compta en neu tova, molsa, terres de bosc i capes "
"fines. No amb el model de dos paràmetres"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Ground"
msgstr "Terreny"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Model"
msgstr "Model"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Flow resistivity"
msgstr "Resistivitat al flux"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Layer thickness"
msgstr "Gruix de la capa"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Porosity rate"
msgstr "Caiguda de la porositat"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Reaction"
msgstr "Reacció"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Where the coefficients come from"
msgstr "D'on provenen els coeficients"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "How much of the room's surface has this material"
msgstr "Quina part de la superfície del recinte té aquest material"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Remove material"
msgstr "Eliminar material"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid ""
"Remove this material and the assignments that use it; its surfaces take the "
"default material"
msgstr ""
"Eliminar aquest material i les assignacions que el fan servir; les seves "
"superfícies prenen el material per defecte"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/inspector.py
msgid "Source: the ground's impedance"
msgstr "Font: la impedància del terreny"

